<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">拍一张包装</view>
    <view class="muted">对准配料表和营养成分表，尽量拍清楚小字</view>

    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="takePhoto" disabled="{{scanning}}">拍照</button>
    <button class="btn-secondary" bindtap="fromAlbum" disabled="{{scanning}}">从相册选</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{scanning}}">
    <view class="muted">{{progress}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card bg-warn" wx:if="{{error}}">
    <view class="level-warn">{{error.message}}</view>
    <view class="muted small" wx:if="{{error.detail}}">{{error.detail}}</view>
    <button class="btn-secondary" wx:if="{{error.canManual}}" bindtap="manualEntry">手动填写关键数值</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row" bindtap="gotoFamily">
      <text>家庭成员</text><text class="muted">配置谁要注意什么 ›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="gotoHistory">
      <text>历史记录</text><text class="muted">看之前扫过的 ›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="muted small" style="padding: 16rpx 8rpx;">
    结论依据包装标注与公开标准自动生成，仅供家庭参考，不构成医疗或营养建议。
  </view>
</view>
